  "description": "LUYBUD crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P n m a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C132 H166 Eu4 N4 O19 S12,C40 H48 O4 S4,8(C3 H7 N1 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.545-5.081 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.68-178.62°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C132H166Eu4N4O19S12·C40H48O4S4·8(dmf).",
